an style="width:100%"><p>Jamie W.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R71r2:-trigger-190c37ac-d2ab-4336-a470-38194faff5ef2" id="radix-:R71r2:-content-190c37ac-d2ab-4336-a470-38194faff5ef2" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="78cf328d-198a-4962-b36d-a33e673d70e5" class="r-v6us8y"><div data-rid="cd22e125-cbaa-4046-91b4-c89fecc35960" class="r-1ftunna"><picture data-rid="92f6461b-8448-474b-8a99-be5fbff91b1b" class="r-hh5ay8"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0114/8547/8993/files/group_4_3_35bf4743-9914-49b8-90fe-30940fcc68ac.webp?v=1737325089&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0114/8547/8993/files/group_4_3_35bf4743-9914-49b8-90fe-30940fcc68ac.webp?v=1737325089&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0114/8547/8993/files/group_4_3_35bf4743-9914-49b8-90fe-30940fcc68ac.webp?v=1737325089&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0114/8547/8993/files/group_4_3_35bf4743-9914-49b8-90fe-30940fcc68ac.webp?v=1737325089" alt="A row of five green stars indicating a five-star rating." class="r-1d9o46f" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="069ccc03-9c2a-492e-9ddf-43b51672ae79" class="r-pbtmzj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>WOW! I’ve tried a ton of green “things” over the years and I have to say, Grüns FOR THE WIN! I was taking AG1 but even with their monthly subscription discount it was still $94 a month and the drink was definitely gritty/chalky. Grüns literally tastes like fruit snacks I ate as a kid. And there isn’t a bad aftertaste either! On top of that, they are super convenient, half the price of what I was paying with AG1, and offer the same benefits and then some! P.S. I never do reviews, but these are amazing!</p></span></div><div data